%% The states of a todo (docs/user/tags.md#flow-tags-for-todos, daily.md#what-appears-on-daily).
flowchart TB
  IN["`**Inbox**: added without a project or area`"]
  P["`In a project or area, e.g. Garden renovation`"]
  IN -- "filed" --> P
  P --> N["`**Next**
  #next`"]
  P --> W["`**w/f**
  #wf/marco`"]
  P --> PL["`**Plan**
  no flow tag`"]
  P --> S["`**Someday** · **Maybe**`"]
  N --> D["`**Daily**: every #next, what is due today, tomorrow or overdue, and w/f without a date or due`"]
  W --> D
  PL -- "when due" --> D
  S --> R["`Review step **Someday / Maybe**`"]
  D --> X["`done ☑ [completion:: date]`"]
  P -. "no #next and nothing you wait for" .-> ST["`Review step **Stalled projects**: **→ Next**`"]
